dn: olcDatabase={1}mdb,cn=config
olcAccess: to dn.subtree="ou=users,dc=finnes,dc=dev" filter="(memberOf=cn=media.jellyfin-users,ou=groups,dc=finnes,dc=dev)" attrs=entry,uid,cn,displayName,givenName,sn,mail,memberOf,jpegPhoto by dn.exact="uid=media.jellyfin,ou=system,dc=finnes,dc=dev" read by * break
